# Kinich Emilie Dehya Bennett. ~18s Rot. E 5[N2 shE] (Q) combo with consistently NA clockwise. 5 Quickscope Scalespiker Cannon Combo with Interruption Resistance. No Kinich short can leads to missed a cannon shots, resulting in significant DPS loss. Dehya uses SacGS to lower her skill cd for a shorter rotation. KQMS Stats.

# Team
kinich char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
kinich add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
#kinich add weapon="earthshaker" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
kinich add set="ur" count=4;
#kinich add set="obsidiancodex" count=4;
kinich add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 dendro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
kinich add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.1984 er=0.1102 em=39.64 cr=0.3972 cd=0.662; # UR, SS/ ES, OC
#kinich add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 dendro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
#kinich add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.3968 er=0.1102 em=39.64 cr=0.2648 cd=0.662; # SS, OC

emilie char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9; 
emilie add weapon="deathmatch" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
emilie add set="ur" count=4;
emilie add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 dendro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
emilie add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.1984 er=0.1102 em=39.64 cr=0.3972 cd=0.662;

dehya char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
dehya add weapon="sacgs" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
dehya add set="deepwood" count=4;
dehya add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 pyro%=0.466 cr=0.311;
dehya add stats hp=507.88 hp%=0.0991 atk=33.07 atk%=0.1982 def=39.35 def%=0.1239 em=39.63 er=0.1101 cr=0.3305 cd=0.7926;

bennett char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
bennett add weapon="alleyflash" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
bennett add set="no" count=4;
bennett add stats hp=4780 atk=311 er=0.518 pyro%=0.466 cr=0.311 ; #main
bennett add stats def=39.36 def%=0.124 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.551 em=39.64 cr=0.1986 cd=0.662;

options swap_delay=12 iteration=1000;
target lvl=100 resist=0.1 radius=2 pos=0,2.5 hp=999999999; 
energy every interval=480,720 amount=1;

active kinich; # SS Stacks

emilie skill;

for let i=0; i<4; i=i+1{
  if i > 0 && .dehya.skill.cd {
    bennett skill;
  }
  
  dehya skill:2;
  
  bennett skill, burst;
  
  if i {
    if .emilie.burst.ready {
      emilie burst;
    } else {
      emilie skill, attack;
    }
  }
  
  kinich skill;
  
  for let c=0; c<5; c=c+1 { 
    kinich attack[direction=1]:2;
    while .kinich.nightsoul.points < 20 && .kinich.nightsoul.state {
      wait(1);
    }
    if .kinich.nightsoul.state {
      kinich skill[hold=1];
    }
  }
  if .kinich.burst.ready {
    kinich burst;
  }
}
